ig\/e4471bf6c6e30ffa50022fa2d9e308ca.webp?t=1793357304 width=1560 height=335 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jabs, straights, hooks, uppercuts, and overhands — choose your punch selection and make it count. Master timing, counters, slipping punches, head movement, and parrying to edge the upper hand, in boxing that's built to feel real, not scripted. Your stance shifts to in-fighting the moment you get up close and personal with your opponent. Slick, Bully, or Balanced: three distinct boxing styles, each with its own strengths, weaknesses, and way of winning a fight. Learn yours, or get exposed. Tie up your opponent and deliver punches in the clinch to wear them down, before the referee steps in.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3740090\/extras\/956183ce7d19d6e4c7095a553e684f24.avif?t=1793357304\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3740090\/extras_big\/956183ce7d19d6e4c7095a553e684f24.webp?t=1793357304 width=1560 height=335 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start from nothing and climb from amateur to pro through training, wins, and tough choices, with every step feeding a career that actually grows with you. Or drop into the underground bareknuckle leagues instead.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3740090\/extras\/6fb99164774f6a96e17f678fe7ed9810.avif?t=1793357304\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3740090\/extras_big\/6fb99164774f6a96e17f678fe7ed9810.webp?t=1793357304 width=1560 height=876 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3740090\/extras\/2c6c7b7ee8946268d19cb95d81e1298b.avif?t=1793357304\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3740090\/extras_big\/2c6c7b7ee8946268d19cb95d81e1298b.webp?t=1793357304 width=1560 height=335 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Balance workouts, job shifts, and nutrition to stay healthy, level up, and make money to fund your needs between fights. Train, eat, survive, in that order.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3740090\/extras\/0cab1da77b0378a1234f4208896f8c1b.avif?t=1793357304\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3740090\/extras_big\/0cab1da77b0378a1234f4208896f8c1b.webp?t=1793357304 width=1560 height=335 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Push too hard and you'll pay for it. Managing your injuries and your health matters as much as anything that happens in the ring. Stay sharp and recover smart.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3740090\/extras\/14777ac6f618706caa1d6e4b8aacfe44.avif?t=1793357304\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3740090\/extras_big\/14777ac6f618706caa1d6e4b8aacfe44.webp?t=1793357304 width=1560 height=335 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A throwback art style carries modern gameplay systems and detail underneath. Retro on the surface, deeper than it looks.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you’re a hardcore fight fan or just love a gritty, underdog story with old-school flavor, Bruisers 2D Boxing brings you the chance to <strong>create your own boxing journey.<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alongside the gameplay, Bruisers benefits from a 16-bit-inspired soundtrack, with hours of music lovingly handcrafted by Nick Bassett.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3740090\/extras\/205a539229bea1b157566a0eeb9ac6ad.avif?t=1793357304\" width=192 height=222 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p>","short_description":"Bruisers is unlike any boxing game before it. Climb from amateur bouts to the top of the pros. Train, eat, fight, dope, and deal with anyone who wants a piece of you on the way up — but tread lightly. Some consequences here are fatal.","supported_languages":"English<strong>*<\/strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Portuguese - Brazil, Spanish - Latin America, Japanese, Korean, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Turkish<br><strong>*<\/strong>languages with full audio support","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3740090\/96db6e5b79037fd26fd62f0d9bb56419c4caef13\/header.jpg?t=1793357304","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3740090\/db5d22d8757333ada8766d60bc287e515e920742\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793357304","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3740090\/db5d22d8757333ada8766d60bc287e515e920742\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793357304","website":"https:\/\/discord.gg\/cPrjaRNg5Q","pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10 (64-bit)<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Dual-core 2.0 GHz<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 4 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>